MODULE: PlanSkipsUndecided
TARGET: RebuildReplayEntitled
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a scanned undecided prepare is skipped by the rebuild resume floor
PERTURBS: Plan

--- FIND
    /\ floor' = [p \in Partitions |-> IF heads[p] > 0 /\ p < ScanLimit /\
                      ~AllCommitted(heads) /\ ~abandoned THEN 0 ELSE heads[p]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ floor' = heads
--- END
